          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Learn key techniques for improving website accessibility",
          "_key": "k0008"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0009",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "O3 believes accessibility is not just a feature—it’s a fundamental right that every company should consider in their digital experience. Our leading accessibility expert, in partnership with ",
          "_key": "k0010"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "Tamman Inc",
          "_key": "k0011"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", is hosting a practical webinar to provide solutions and tools. In this session, we will explore the importance of making websites accessible for all users and provide simple yet effective strategies to achieve it.",
          "_key": "k0012"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
